<title>USA: Three-Five Systems Inc wins contract.</title>
<headline>Three-Five Systems Inc wins contract.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-Five Systems Inc said Tuesday it had won a manufacturing contract to produce user interface modules for an unnamed manufacturer of electronic measurement, computing and communications systems.</p>
<p>Details of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
